:: MP NPC Noel More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
标本室的窗台晒着成排干草药，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>先习惯性地搭了搭你的脉，才翻开夹着干花书签的杂务册。她说这几天的活计得按干湿分开：刷标本瓶、拣药种与糊烘房窗缝归在白昼室务，清虫蛀药柜与雾夜送煎药归在入夜药务，药圃守夜、古籍修复与花期祭则另记在后院专册里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前厅 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[先看白昼室务 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[先翻入夜药务页 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpmushroomicon>><<link [[查看后院与花期祭 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
白昼室务页记着标本室里急需搭手的三件细活。地上的两排广口瓶<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel10>>已经刷净换液并用蜂蜡封口<<else>>药液发浑起絮，等着刷洗瓶壁重封蜡口<</if>>；被鼠咬破的种子抽屉<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel11>>已经挑出霉种并排好湿布试芽<<else>>混进了霉粒，得逐粒挑拣试芽<</if>>；烘房的木窗<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel12>>已经用石灰麻丝嵌平并糊好桑皮纸<<else>>旧灰干裂漏风，再不糊严实会吹伤嫩叶<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>递给你一条干净围裙。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[去刷标本瓶壁 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 10]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[挑拣抽屉霉草种 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 11]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[嵌灰修补烘房窗缝 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 12]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
入夜药务页记着傍晚以后的两桩差事。靠墙的百眼旧药柜<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel13>>已经逐格清扫并挂上了艾叶驱虫囊<<else>>飞出了灰白药蛾，柜底积灰里混着虫卵，急需清柜挂驱虫囊<</if>>；长廊尽头的病号房<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel14>>已经送去头煎并替她盯完了二服药火<<else>>正等着夜里的温里汤药，雾天路冷还得有人替看二煎火候<</if>>。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>替你系好防尘布巾。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回杂务总册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[清理虫蛀药柜 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Daily 13]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[趁雾夜陪她送煎药 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Daily 14]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _noelYearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
后院专册夹着两处安静的同行与春日花期祭。后墙小门内的夜药圃<<if $daily.mpNpcDateNoel5>>今夜已经覆好防霜草帘<<else>>入夜容易落霜招虫，得有人帮着覆帘候露<</if>>；图书馆后廊的古籍修复室<<if $daily.mpNpcDateNoel6>>今日已经揭开受潮粘页<<else>>存着一册受潮粘连的旧本草，得用温水汽慢慢润揭修补<</if>>。至于一年一度的花期祭，<<if (_npc.festivalYear or 0) is _noelYearNow>>今年的祭礼已经记入标本册<<elseif Time.season is "spring">>眼下正是配制花期药膳与护苗的时节<<else>>要等春深百花齐放时才会启幕<</if>>。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先去药圃护苗 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Date 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[前往后廊修本草 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel Date 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<if _npc.hasMet and Time.season is "spring" and ((_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot _noelYearNow)>><<mplampicon>><<link [[翻看春日花期祭册 (0:05)|MP NPC Noel Festival Prep]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">花期祭未启（需春季且今年未过）</span><</if>>
:: MP NPC Noel Daily 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
清早的标本室地上摆开两排广口瓶，旧浸泡液已经发浑起絮。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>先检查你的手指没有破皮，才把长柄竹刷与融蜡小锅递过来：瓶壁的菌膜得顺着同一个方向刷净，换入新配的防腐液后再蘸热蜂蜡把瓶口封死。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel10>>两排广口瓶已经澄澈见底，瓶口封着齐整的淡黄蜂蜡。<<else>>蜂蜡在铜锅里正化成温润的浅金。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回白昼室务 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[握长刷洗瓶壁 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel10 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel10 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[蘸热蜂蜡封紧瓶口 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel10 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel10 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
晌午的阳光照在桌面上，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把被灰鼠咬破底板的种子抽屉端上长桌，先塞给你半块温热的茯苓糕垫肚子。混在一起的甘菊与紫苏籽里掺了不少空壳与霉粒，得用竹镊挑出饱满的好种，再排在湿棉布上试发芽率。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel11>>好种已经分装进陶罐，湿棉布上的试芽盘也标好了日期。<<else>>她戴上圆框细镜，与你并排坐下。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回白昼室务 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[用竹镊挑霉种 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel11 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel11 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[铺开湿棉布排草种 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel11 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($science or 0) gte 220 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel11 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
午后的穿堂风把烘房木门吹得轻晃，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>从矮梯上下来，先拉过你的手背试了试冷暖。烘房窗框的旧油灰干裂脱落，冷风直往菌架上灌；得先用桐油熟灰混着细麻丝把裂缝嵌实，再裁两道韧性十足的桑皮纸糊住内框。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel12>>烘房窗缝已经封得严严实实，屋里的温气重新稳了下来。<<else>>木盆里的油灰正散着淡淡的桐油香。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回白昼室务 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[调桐油灰嵌缝 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel12 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel12 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[裁齐桑皮纸糊木窗 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel12 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel12 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
天色擦黑，旧药柜一开便扑出一只灰白药蛾。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>立刻抽出干净棉布巾替你系在口鼻上，叮嘱说柜底的陈灰混着虫卵，吸进去容易呛咳。整面药柜三十六个抽斗都要逐一抽出扫净，再在四角挂上塞满干艾叶与丁香的驱虫小囊。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel13>>三十六格药斗已经清扫一空，艾叶与丁香的清苦香气弥漫全屋。<<else>>她递给你一把软毛药帚。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回入夜药务 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[逐格抽出清柜 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel13 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel13 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[缝好艾叶驱虫香囊 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel13 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel13 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
夜雾漫过学园后廊，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>挎着盖了厚棉布的食盒在门口等你，一见面先探了探你的额头，把自己的羊毛披肩分了一半搭在你肩上。食盒里是给校舍值夜老人送的头煎温里汤，炉上还煨着二煎，必须守着文火慢收成半碗。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel14>>头煎已经趁热送到老人手里，二煎也稳稳收好装进了瓷瓶。<<else>>药炉上的瓦罐正冒着细密的白汽。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回入夜药务 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[提灯陪她送药 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel14 to 1>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel14 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[守在炉旁替看药火 (0:08)|MP NPC Noel Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel14 to 2>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or _npc.axis gte 15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel14 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
入夜后后墙小门只开了一条缝，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>提着防风灯站在药圃畦头，脚边搁着四卷厚草帘与长柄竹夹。她先按了按你的手腕确认脉息平稳，才说今夜地面返潮得厉害，既要替畏寒的幼苗覆帘防霜，又要趁夜露凝结时捉净叶背的蛞蝓。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[随她进夜药圃 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先看畦头湿度读数 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date 5 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
四卷厚草帘在墙根排开，泥土里透出微苦的甘菊根气息。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把麻绳、长柄夹与采露小瓷瓶依次摆在石凳上，退后半步端详了片刻，问你想先帮她做哪一样。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回小门 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Date 5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[展开草帘防霜 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Date 5 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set _npc.datePick to 1>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[提灯巡畦捉蛞蝓 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Date 5 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set _npc.datePick to 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[静候子夜凝露采叶 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Date 5 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set _npc.datePick to 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date 5 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _pick to (_npc.datePick or 1)>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateNoel5>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateNoel5 to 1>>
夜药圃里的活计收尾时，灯笼在湿泥上映出一圈柔和的暗黄。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>拍去手上的浮土，俯身看了看你沾湿的鞋尖，叮嘱你回去务必用艾叶水把脚泡热。<<if _pick is 1>>四畦幼苗都严严实实盖好了防霜帘，她替你拢好衣领，眼里满是安心。<<elseif _pick is 2>>陶罐里收满了夜出啃叶的蛞蝓，她递来温帕替你擦净指尖。<<else>>带露的嫩叶一片不损地收进瓷瓶，她泡了一杯热甘菊茶与你分饮。<</if>><<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[随她锁好门回屋 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
午后的图书馆后廊比前厅幽静得多，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>抱着用油布包得方方正正的旧本草站在铁皮门前。她先抬手探了探你的眼睑，问你昨晚是不是又熬了夜，随后才推门带你走进摆满竹起子、棉纸与浆糊碗的古籍修复室。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[随她进室修书 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先看本草受潮页码 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date 6 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
大木台上铺着吸潮毛毡，那册百年前的手绘本草有三处伤损：受潮粘连的彩绘叶图需要借温水汽一寸寸润揭，虫蛀的缺口得用同色老棉纸修补贴平，散脱的书脊则要穿麻线重订。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把竹起子与骨针摆齐，让你挑一门稳当的上手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回门口 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Date 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[借水汽揭粘页 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Date 6 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set _npc.datePick to 1>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[裁老棉纸修补虫洞 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Date 6 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set _npc.datePick to 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[穿蜡麻线订书脊 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Date 6 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set _npc.datePick to 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Date 6 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _pick to (_npc.datePick or 1)>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateNoel6>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateNoel6 to 1>>
天快擦黑时，修复室窗口只剩最后一线夕光。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把油布重新盖回压平的旧本草上，四角压稳镇纸，先伸手替你揉了揉发僵的肩颈。<<if _pick is 1>>粘连的药草彩图一页未破地揭了开来，连叶脉墨迹都完好如初。<<elseif _pick is 2>>虫蛀的空洞被老棉纸补得平平整整，透光看去几乎与原纸融为一体。<<else>>新订的蜡麻线把松散的书册重新拢紧，翻动时再不掉半点纸屑。<</if>><<if _first>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[同她捧书回前室 (0:04)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Festival Prep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
花期祭前七天，标本室的窗台腾出了一整排空位。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>先接过你的手腕数了数脉，才端来半杯温润的黄精汤说「不是待客，是方子」。祭上要备齐压制花标本的吸水纸、温养母株的菌丝液与待客的润肺药膳，她抬头看你准备怎么分担。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去备节前物料 (0:10)|MP NPC Noel Festival]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.festivalPrep to 2>><<set $mpNpcs.noel.festivalPrepYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>><<stress -2>><</link>>
:: MP NPC Noel Festival [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
花期祭当天，前院花棚外的人声一直热闹到黄昏才散。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>没有跟着人群凑热闹，抱着半筐刚替换下来的珍稀花枝绕到后院小门前等你。门里是恒温药圃与标本台，今晚要把新花入册、试熬新药膳并守住温室夜温。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[压制新花入册 (0:16)|MP NPC Noel Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<set _npc.festivalPick to "press">><</link>><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[文火慢熬新药膳 (0:18)|MP NPC Noel Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set _npc.festivalPick to "brew">><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[陪她在温室守夜温 (0:20)|MP NPC Noel Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 20>><<if !$daily.mpLock_MPNPCNoelFestival_4>><<set $daily.mpLock_MPNPCNoelFestival_4 to 1>><<set _npc.festivalPick to "watch">><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Festival Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _first to ((_npc.festivalYear or 0) isnot (Time.date.year or 0))>>
<<set _prepReady to (((_npc.festivalPrep or 0) gte 2) or ((_npc.festivalPrepYear or 0) is (Time.date.year or 0)))>>
<<set _ok to (_prepReady and (($tending or 0) gte 200 or ($science or 0) gte 200 or (_npc.axis or 0) gte 30))>>
<<set _part to (_prepReady or ($willpower or 0) gte 260)>>
温室的玻璃顶映着春夜星光，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>将最后一页花期记录合拢。<<if _ok>>新收的花枝与母株菌丝完美共生，药膳清润甘甜，她把你的脉案与今年的花谱装订在同一册里。<<set _npc.festivalResult to "ok">><<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 6)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -4>><<if _npc.festivalPick is "press">><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<elseif _npc.festivalPick is "brew">><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</if>><<elseif _part>>半数花枝顺利入册，只是夜深时温室炉火微偏，她替你披上厚袄守完了下半夜。<<set _npc.festivalResult to "part">><<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 3)>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>>春寒倒灌进温室，新采的花瓣受潮发暗，没能制成合用的标本，也没换来半分贴补。<<set _npc.festivalResult to "fail">><<if _first>><<set _npc.axis to Math.max(0, (_npc.axis or 0) - 3)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</if>><<if _npc.festivalPick is "press">>压好的花册收进樟木柜。<<elseif _npc.festivalPick is "brew">>余下的药膳盛进粗陶碗。<<else>>封好的炉火压上一层灰。<</if>><<set _npc.festivalYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
标本室的铜壶冒着细密白汽，玻璃皿里的叶片在恒温灯下泛着微光。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _npc.festivalResult is "fail">><<walkicon>><<link [[查看错过的花祭 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Festival Missed]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<mpherbicon>><<link [[帮她收拢祭后药具 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel Festival After]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Noel Festival After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
花期祭过后的清晨，温室里弥漫着微苦的草木清气。<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>把压好的花册码上木架，转身端来一碗温热的甘菊蜂蜜水让你润嗓。<<if _npc.festivalResult is "ok">>她指着玻璃皿里新发出的翠绿菌芽，说今年有你搭手，连最娇气的母株都没掉一片叶子。<<elseif _npc.festivalResult is "part">>她把略受潮的花瓣晒在竹匾里，说留着入茶也不算糟蹋。<<else>>她仔细修剪掉受冻的枝叶，说明年提前备好炭盆就能护全。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[陪她吹熄守夜风灯 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><<if !$daily.mpLock_MPNPCNoelFestivalAfter_2>><<set $daily.mpLock_MPNPCNoelFestivalAfter_2 to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Festival Missed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
花期祭那晚，温室的花没能护住。次日再去标本室时，木桌上堆着几筐蔫掉的残花，<<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>独自守了一整夜温室，眼下透着淡淡的乌青。她见你进门还是先搭了搭你的手腕，只说花期不等人，好在根还活着，明年还能再开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回后院专册 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[帮她收残花入囊 (0:06)|MP NPC Noel More2 Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 10 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel10 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel10 or 0)>>
日头刚爬过高窗，两排广口瓶在长桌上晾着，铜锅里的蜂蜡冒着细烟。<<if _act is 1>>你握着长柄竹刷，顺同一方向把瓶壁菌膜刷净。<<if _ok>>新配防腐液清亮见底，透光寻不到一丝挂膜。<<else>>末排刷到手臂发酸，两瓶角落仍留雾痕，只得返工。<</if>><<else>>你端蜡勺沿瓶口淋一圈，趁热按实瓶塞。<<if _ok>>冷却后每只瓶口严丝合缝，灯下不见渗漏。<<else>>蜂蜡凝得太快，三只瓶口裂出细缝，要刮掉重封。<</if>><</if>> <<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>逐行核对瓶号，才拍掉围裙上的蜡屑。
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel10>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel10 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 11 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel11 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel11 or 0)>>
晌午的光落在长桌上，甘菊与紫苏籽摊成两小堆。<<if _act is 1>>你捏着竹镊一粒粒拣，把空壳和霉粒拨到废纸里。<<if _ok>>好种挑得匀净，装罐时响得像细沙。<<else>>挑到眼花漏下几粒霉种，只好倒回重拣。<</if>><<else>>你把湿棉布铺平，按格距把好种一粒粒摆开。<<if _ok>>芽盘排得齐整，标签也写好了日期。<<else>>布面干得太快，边角几粒没能吸足水。<</if>><</if>> <<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>替你把袖口的种壳拂净，说下午再来看芽。
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel11>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel11 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Noel Daily 12 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel12 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel12 or 0)>>
穿堂风把烘房门吹得轻晃，窗框的旧油灰簌簌往下掉。<<if _act is 1>>你用竹片把桐油熟灰压进裂缝，麻丝嵌得密实。<<if _ok>>窗缝嵌平，冷风再也钻不进来。<<else>>灰调得太稀，干了以后裂出两道新口。<</if>><<else>>你裁好两道桑皮纸，就着浆糊贴住内框。<<if _ok>>纸面绷得平展，屋里温气慢慢稳下来。<<else>>边角没压牢，起了一阵鼓包，只得撕下重糊。<</if>><</if>> <<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>伸手试了试窗缝的冷暖，把剩下的灰盆端走。
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel12>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel12 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
