:: MP NPC Noel Daily 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel13 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel13 or 0)>>
天色擦黑，旧药柜一开，几只灰白药蛾扑棱着飞出来。<<if _act is 1>>你抽出三十六格药斗，一格格扫净积灰，再用湿布抹过。<<if _ok>>抽斗里外干净，连柜底的虫卵也清光了。<<else>>扫到一半呛得直咳，最底两格还留着陈灰。<</if>><<else>>你把干艾叶与丁香塞进小布袋，一针针缝住袋口。<<if _ok>>香囊挂满四角，清苦气味压住了霉味。<<else>>线脚缝得松，两只香囊漏了半袋碎叶。<</if>><</if>> <<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>摘下口鼻上的棉布巾，替你拍了拍肩上的灰。
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel13>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel13 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回日常页 (0:02)|MP NPC Noel Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
