:: MP NPC Noel Daily 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcNoel>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.noel>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActNoel14 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkNoel14 or 0)>>
夜雾漫过后廊，食盒上的厚棉布结了一层细密水珠。<<if _act is 1>>你提着灯陪她走过湿滑的石阶，把温里汤送到值夜老人手里。<<if _ok>>老人捧着碗道谢，汤还烫着，药气没散。<<else>>路上灯被雾气罩住，汤洒了小半碗，只得折回重盛。<</if>><<else>>你守在瓦罐旁，把二煎文火慢慢收成半碗。<<if _ok>>药汁收得浓亮，倒入瓷瓶时一滴不剩。<<else>>火候大了些，锅底结了薄薄一层焦。<</if>><</if>> <<if _npc.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>分你一半披肩，说回去先把湿鞋换下。
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyNoel14>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailyNoel14 to 1>>
<<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
